Game Description TORMENTOR takes you on a journey through the twisted mind of a maniac. Take on the role of a ruthless torturer who has taken over an abandoned prison filled with victims sentenced to death. As the game progresses, you will struggle with a developing mental illness that robs you of your memories and causes dangerous episodes of fainting. To keep your mind under control, you&rsquo;ll work with an organized crime group that operates on the dark web to obtain an experimental sanity-preserving drug for you.
You will build a modern prison in the ruins of an ancient temple, creating opportunities to prepare a truly hellish labyrinth for your victims. Using the power of ray tracing, you will create unusual traps that will confuse your prey, giving you the edge you need during the hunt. Look for the best deals and enrich the prison cells with new instruments of torture to prepare your victims for the dangerous game. You will satisfy the hellish lusts of your sponsors and win increasingly darker contracts by eliminating people who are inconvenient for them. The game offers an extremely powerful character customization system that allows you to create new victims for your prison. Give them a name, choose a tone of voice and add a detailed description on the figure&rsquo;s card, then use the camera to live-stream her torture! You can also instill in your victims a thirst for revenge, and then give them weapons and let them finally hunt&hellip; you!
