Game Description Mara is about a daring robbery of an ancient tomb, recently discovered by a group of archaeologists far from prying eyes. The events take place in the vicinity of an abandoned mine located near the city, in the depths of which a tomb with priceless relics is hidden. The main character, being an experienced thief, receives an order from a buyer of stolen goods to steal these artifacts for their subsequent sale. The main task is to secretly penetrate inside and remove all valuable items found during the exploration of the location. To do this, it is necessary to carefully study not only the tomb itself, but also the adjacent forest areas that hide the approaches to the goal. The search for valuables will require maximum attentiveness and secrecy from the protagonist, because the discovery of scientists has not yet become known to the general public.
To complete such a difficult task, the protagonist will need to use all his professional skills. In Mara, the player has access to a unique ability called Thieves' Sense, which becomes the main tool in the passage. Activating it allows you to highlight important objects for progress and traces left by someone, helping you navigate the intricate corridors of the tomb and find hidden paths in the forest. Thus, the entire gameplay is based on exploring locations, searching for artifacts and using special vision to detect valuables. However, the path to wealth will not be easy, because ancient ruins can conceal not only treasures, but also dangers. Successful completion of the mission depends on how effectively the gamer can use these mechanics.
Game Screenshots &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;    &times;

Game Description Pro Basketball Manager 2026 is a comprehensive basketball management simulation that integrates the licensed Champions League competition with authentic rosters and athletes for the first time. The manager is in charge of the full range of club affairs, from budget planning and team formation to building game strategies and maintaining a healthy microclimate in the team. Over 2,000 professional teams from 90 national championships are available for management, including 17 women&rsquo;s leagues. The graphics have been overhauled with the introduction of new 3D technology, ensuring match images are up-to-date with fresh athlete models, cutting-edge animations and an improved lighting system. The user shell has also been redesigned to ensure intuitive menu navigation and faster information processing.
A central place in the gameplay is given to the modeling of interpersonal relationships and psychology. To achieve positive results in Pro Basketball Manager 2026, you will need to take into account the complex mechanics of team interaction, where the mutual understanding of athletes is influenced by recognized leaders, veterans and the accumulated experience of joint performances. The manager will have to solve a number of diverse management issues. It will be necessary to establish connections on the floor, conduct complex dialogues about the purchase and expulsion of athletes, taking responsibility for personnel decisions. In addition, responsibilities include organizing preparatory meetings to refine strategies or gain commercial benefits, as well as funding a breeding service and an in-house school to train the next generation of talent.
