Game Description Assetto Corsa Rally is an uncompromising simulator that challenges drivers to push powerful cars to their limits. Each track, be it the gravel roads of Wales or the asphalt serpentines of Alsace, is recreated using laser scanning technology. This approach made it possible to transfer the real width of roads, the profile of roadsides and all surface irregularities into virtual space with the highest accuracy. Each race turns into a tense test, where the slightest mistake due to the treacherous terrain can become fatal, and success depends on instant decisions and filigree driving techniques.
Assetto Corsa Rally is based on an advanced physics engine specially adapted for rally disciplines. The behavior of front-wheel drive, rear-wheel drive and all-wheel drive vehicles varies significantly depending on the grip on the surface. Weather conditions and time of day are not just visual effects, but full-fledged simulation elements that directly affect handling. Immersion in the process is enhanced by authentic engine sounds and professional navigator transcripts recorded with the participation of real athletes. A well-developed damage system takes into account not only external deformations, but also their direct impact on the car’s behavior on the track. This project offers deep and demanding gameplay, where the result is determined solely by the skill of the pilot.
