Game Description Explosive Odds is a multiplayer competition where financial dominance is achieved through risky bets and the smart use of unique skills. The basis of the gameplay is the betting system, which allows you not only to increase bets in the general pot, but also to conclude side deals on the outcome of your opponents’ actions. To gain an advantage, there are tactical options such as canceling someone else&rsquo;s skill, copying the last skill used, or completely upgrading your own set of abilities. Before the start of each session, flexible adjustment of the rules is allowed, including starting capital and the complete removal of restrictions on the size of bets, which allows you to personalize each match.
All of these mechanics serve one purpose - to survive intense rounds filled with a variety of mini-games. Participants will have to try their luck in an analogue of roulette called Bot Roulette or test their intuition in the Seventeen card discipline. Completing Explosive Odds requires gamers not only luck, but also cold calculation, because any mistake can lead to inevitable detonation. Online confrontations for a company of up to 4 people take place in a first-person view, and the overall atmosphere combines elements of science fiction and comedy. The built-in support system helps those behind by providing a small amount to those who start the round with a zero balance.
