The gameplay is entirely focused on the classic elements of detective work. Gamers will have to carefully examine crime scenes in search of evidence that can shed light on the identity of the killer. An important part of the passage will be the interrogation of witnesses and suspects, where it is necessary to separate truth from lies. To advance through the plot of Chains of Judgment, you will also need to solve various puzzles, connecting disparate facts together. Partial voice acting of the characters gives the story additional atmosphere, immersing you in a story about the search for a missing friend and the hunt for a ruthless maniac.
