Game Description Saga of the Moon Priestess is a retro top-down adventure with gameplay built on classic mechanics from the 8-bit and 16-bit eras. An orphan named Sarissa comes under control, whose main tool for eliminating opponents is a spear. The combat system involves targeted attacks, and progress through locations often depends on solving puzzles using found equipment. The heroine&rsquo;s arsenal is gradually replenished with bombs and a bow, while in order to achieve her goals she must actively interact with the environment, even using stones as weapons. Destroying vegetation and various objects allows you to replenish resources, while dialogues with non-player characters reveal the details of what is happening.
The plot outlines the rescue of a kidnapped prince in the fantasy world of Lunaria. Saga of the Moon Priestess involves sequential exploration of five regions, including grasslands, deserts and icy lands, each of which contains a dungeon with unique enemies and a boss. Access to new territories opens after finding 15 special items. Victories over powerful opponents are rewarded with Tears of the Goddess, which increase the heroine&rsquo;s maximum health. Progress is saved at the statues of the Moon Goddess, who also acts as a guide for Sarissa in her wanderings.
