Game Description My Winter Car is a survival simulator in which harsh winter conditions become the main obstacle to restoring an old sports car. The need to constantly monitor body temperature and select appropriate clothing is the key to survival in the world of the project. Any mistake that results in freezing is fatal and entails an irreversible loss of all progress made. The vehicle restoration process is highly detailed, with each of the nearly 200 unique parts requiring the correct tools and specific hardware for installation. The financial side of the issue is resolved by fulfilling orders from local residents, which opens up access to the market for new and used spare parts.
