Game Description Out To Deliver is a dynamic arcade action game that asks you to take control of an armed scooter in an unusual fantasy setting. Maneuvering through explosive medieval routes requires maximum concentration from the protagonist. A variety of threats constantly appear along the way, from hostile knights to fire-breathing bats and obstacles that suddenly appear out of nowhere. The basis of everything is the synthesis of high-speed driving and targeted shooting from the first person. Each attempt to complete a level is unique thanks to elements of roguelight progression that force you to adapt to new challenges. The main task in this chaos is not the total destruction of opponents, but the fight against economic difficulties through the timely execution of orders for kings, wizards and other colorful inhabitants of the world.
