Game Description Rise of Nations: Thrones and Patriots, although not a full-fledged project, still allows you to play online with a friend on a pirate. This is an addition to the original game, where users will have access to new units, nations and campaigns. In addition, they will be able to choose types of government, which was not the case before. Events take place on a global map, and the user himself decides in which area to begin active actions. For beginner gamers, there is an option to undergo training before they start an online session on the Internet. List of some nations and their features in &ldquo;Rise of Nations: Thrones and Patriots&rdquo;: Americans - the cost of air units has been reduced, the option of instant construction of the first wonder of the world is available, and it is also possible to change the form of government for free. Incas - in the mines in addition metal can mine gold, and when an allied unit is destroyed, the user receives 25% of its cost. Koreans - at the beginning of the campaign a temple is given, which speeds up research in the field of religion. Buildings are repaired faster, and during shelling there are no fines for this. Mongols - the cost of cavalry is reduced by 10%, and units are built 20% faster. Persians - an increased supply of food is given from the start, and the second city built also receives capital status. For the enemy to gain the upper hand, he needs to capture both settlements.
