It turns out that all realities are threatened by some destructive force. The hero appeared in the First Kingdom, which had only a day left to exist. The protagonist, who has hidden and powerful potential, must prepare to then meet the End. To do this, he needs to find one of the Primordial Hearts. The reality in which the action takes place consists of Essence. The protagonist can extract this essence from NPCs and surrounding elements to mix it and craft items. He also has the ability Memento Mori, which allows him to replay the day over again. To avoid losing created items, it is better to put them in temporary storage before using this skill.
