Game Description On the pirateVietcong 2 you can play online for free with players from all over the world or team up with a friend online to fight in versus or co-op modes. The gameplay is represented by tactical mechanics. The online game offers you to choose one of the sides in the conflict: the United States or Vietnam. Each faction has its own unique characteristics and fights with individual weapons.
Two story campaigns are presented. When playing the US Army you will need to take on the role of KOVPV Captain Douglas Brown. His task is to accompany an American journalist. The latter has important information and creates material about the local New Year in Hue at the time the truce was announced. However, the Viet Cong violate the agreements and launch a full-scale offensive, called the Tet Offensive. The Vietnam story puts you in the role of a new recruit from the Northern Armed Forces to fight the southerners. The action takes place among rice fields, jungles, villages and the Imperial Palace. Mechanics and content of Vietcong 2: first-person tactics and interaction with the environment; the possibility of free online play, including cooperative battles; a look at the Vietnam War from both sides of the conflict; many different tasks and a huge number of unique situations; a variety of small arms , corresponding to the original prototypes; authenticity of the atmosphere of the late 60s.
