Game Description Who&rsquo;s Your Daddy REMAKE is a fun multiplayer adventure that you can play online on a pirate for free, competing with a friend or random players. The main goal is to prevent the death of his son. Participants control a clumsy father or try to play mischief as a crawling toddler. You will need to explore a huge house. It has multiple floors and 69 potentially lethal items to interact with.
The improved version of Who&rsquo;s Your Daddy REMAKE features many new characters, items, skins, updated physics, online play and many other improvements. A father&rsquo;s job is to prevent the death of his child. This requires locking cabinets, hiding sharp objects, etc. A child might drink bleach or stick a fork into a socket. Almost everything in the house is life threatening. While controlling the baby, you need to do everything possible to get to the deadly traps. Gameplay and content: Possibility of free network play for 7 people, both online and locally; Interaction with sockets, sinks, nail guns, blenders, pools, etc.; Exploration of a two-story house, yard and garden; About 70 potentially lethal items; Funny physics and ragdoll puppet; Customizing modes and modifying match conditions; Two characters with customizable skins; Procedural generation of locations and items.
